GitHub Markdown reading theme

Live verification: github.com on 2026-10-05, using Chrome CDP in an
isolated signed-out context, Light default and Dark default. Captured
computed styles are in tests/fixtures/github-live-2026-10-05.
Content width, container padding, default link underlines and heading
code padding follow this capture instead of the third-party snapshot.

