selection.bgColor uses bgColor.accent.emphasis at 0.2 alpha in light mode and
0.7 alpha in dark mode. control.checked.bgColor.rest uses the same accent.
Code copy uses fgColor.muted, the Markdown secondary text token. The built-in
GitHub theme uses Mermaid's default/light and dark diagram themes. Custom
themes map their reading palette onto the diagram's semantic color roles.

Alert and heading icons: Primer Octicons, 16px info, light-bulb, report, alert,
stop and link
