ctty7 changes: converted CSS values to native rendering parameters and mapped
TextMate colors to tree-sitter captures. Chinese fallback fonts are non-GitHub
values. The built-in reading surface uses the application's background by user
request; explicit custom backgrounds remain unchanged. Font rasterization and
token boundaries depend on the native platform.
